# Niche's page probes (theme and background colour, Picture in Picture) answer through Niche Helper,
# never through the page's console: a site's DevTools showed __niche_bg:, __niche_theme: and
# __niche_pip: lines on every load. The fixture counts console calls and sees the theme probe run.
niche://open?url=file://${FIXTURES}/Pages/console.html
expect-log loaded file:
wait 3
niche://action/pictureInPicture
wait 2
niche://debug?cdp=Runtime.evaluate&params={"expression":"calls.length+':'+(probes>0)+':'+calls.join('|')"}
expect-log Niche cdp Runtime.evaluate .*"value":"0:true:"
